Package: ksrp-desktop
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6core6t64 | libqt6core6, libqt6widgets6t64 | libqt6widgets6, libqt6network6t64 | libqt6network6
Recommends: curl
Maintainer: KSRP Team <dev@ksrp.dev>
Description: KSPR Desktop - AI Code Analysis Assistant
 KSPR Desktop is a graphical interface for the KSPR CLI,
 an AI-powered code analysis assistant. Features include:
 .
 - AI Chat with KSPR I assistant
 - File management and code ingestion
 - Real-time metrics dashboard
 - Glassmorphism UI design
 .
 Built with Qt6 and React web interface.
